cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cobot Sandbox in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cobot Sandbox"
abstract: >-
  A quick-start MuJoCo environment for robot-manipulation research with live, controllable
  Franka FR3 and UR5e arms (MuJoCo Menagerie models), benchmark-style tasks defined as YAML scenes,
  keyboard/gamepad teleoperation, scripted solvers, headless data collection with bit-exact
  replay, and one shared 8-D action interface.
authors:
  - given-names: "Shan Zheng"
    family-names: "Tan"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shan-sherif/cobot-sandbox"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/cobot-sandbox/"
keywords:
  - robotics
  - robot manipulation
  - MuJoCo
  - simulation
  - imitation learning
  - teleoperation
  - Franka FR3
  - UR5e
